This app is for the use of Eye Community Runners (ECR) to calculate if they are eligible to claim a club award for a race they have run. It uses the club award tables that are specific to ECR.

A member needs to select their gender and the race distance run, enter their official finish time and their date of birth, the app will then calculate and display the award to be claimed and the qualifying time required to acheive that award.

If the time ran does not meet the time required for any award at the input distance/age combination, the app tells the member this.

If no time is input, providing date of birth and race distance is completed, the app will provide a list of times required for each award for that time/distance combination..

Added the ability to complete the award claim form. The user must still select Submit on the actual claim form to make the claim.
